{
  "title": "Questionnaire for Climate Risk and Resilience Assessment of India’s Power Sector",
  "sectionLabel": "Section A: Power Distribution Systems",
  "introduction": "Please answer the following questions to help assess how distribution systems are affected by climate-related stress and identify suitable resilience measures.",
